+**Parameters:**
+*   **Clustering Threshold:** Controls the grouping of scenes. Values tested: 0, 0.005, 0.01, 0.02, 0.04 [S1, unofficial]. Larger thresholds group more scenes, reducing the number of groups and shared models.
